Scope: Convert the four backward loop and replan agent types: `qrspi-backward-loop-detector` (analyzes acceptance failures and determines if replan is needed), `qrspi-replan` (orchestrator — dispatches replan writer and reviewer, triggers pipeline loopback), `qrspi-replan-writer` (produces replan artifacts: backward-loop-analysis.md and phase-NN-replan.md), and `qrspi-replan-reviewer` (reviews replan artifacts for correctness). All use pi agent type convention.
